## Data

`data/processed.cleveland.data` has the same structure as the original UCI file
(303 rows, 14 comma-separated columns with no header, `?` for missing values in
`ca` and `thal`): `age, sex, cp, trestbps, chol, fbs, restecg, thalach, exang,
oldpeak, slope, ca, thal, num`.

> **Note:** The copy of the data in this repository is a **synthetic placeholder**
> with made-up values and identical structure. To use the real public data from
> the [UCI repository](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/45/heart+disease), run
> `make real-data` and then `make report`.
